      "dom_id": "question-83017",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "Which expression is equivalent to $(M∧N)∨R?$",
      "worked_solution": "By the commutative law, $M∧N≡N∧M.$\n\nTherefore, $(M∧N)∨R≡(N∧M)∨R.$\n\nFinally, by the commutative law, we have\n\n$$\n(N∧M)∨R≡R∨(N∧M).\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
